<title>GERMANY: Air cargo up 4.8 pct at Frankfurt in September.</title>
<headline>Air cargo up 4.8 pct at Frankfurt in September.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following tables show cargo handled at Frankfurt airport month by month in 1996. All figures are in tonnes. The percentage change refers to the same period 12 months ago.</p>
<p>Total cargo</p>
<p>			 Monthly total	 Pct change</p>
<p>    Jan		95,458		  -2.4</p>
<p>    Feb		105,706		 +2.5</p>
<p>    March	    120,716		 -0.1</p>
<p>    April	    111,087		 +0.4</p>
<p>    May		110,437		 +5.8</p>
<p>    June	     112,050		 +3.4</p>
<p>    July	     112,815		 +1.0</p>
<p>    August	   110,154		 +4.3</p>
<p>    Sept	     116,896		 +4.8</p>
<p>Cargo by export, import, transit</p>
<p>	     Out     Change   In	 Change   Transit  Change</p>
<p>    Jan    49,467   -1.4    43,755   -3.0     2,236    -9.5</p>
<p>    Feb    54,588   +0.7    48,553   +4.9     2,565    -0.5</p>
<p>    March  62,475   +1.6    55,719   -1.5     2,521   -10.0</p>
<p>    April  58,025   +2.7    50,816   -1.5     2,247   -12.0</p>
<p>    May    58,461   +7.2    49,843   +5.7     2,133   -20.9</p>
<p>    June   61,515   +7.8    48,479   -0.2     2,056   -23.3</p>
<p>    July   62,625   +2.3    48,037    0.0     2,153   -11.7</p>
<p>    Aug    59,371   +6.4    48,704   +2.0     2,078    -0.6</p>
<p>    Sept   61,074   +6.2    53,453   +3.8     2,369    -7.0</p>
<p>Source: Flughafen Frankfurt Main AG, market research department.</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
